  "description": "Born in shadow, feared in the light – Shadowbringer is a close-knit fellowship of adventurers devoted to the fight against chaos. As an elite guild, we combine tactical skill, deep knowledge of our world, and unwavering loyalty to one another. Our members move forward with dark resolve, whether in epic raids or while uncovering the most hidden secrets of the game world.\n\nWhat sets us apart is not only our strength, but also our unity. New members will find an ambitious yet supportive community where respect, humor, and teamwork come first. The path of a Shadowbringer is not easy – but it is legendary.",
